{"ex-E303-1":{"id":"ex-E303-1","chapter":"E303","number":1,"title":"傳導作用的熱傳遞率","question":"<p>房間面向室外的混凝土牆厚 10 cm，面積為 9 m<sup>2</sup>。空調機開動後，牆壁兩面的温度為 25 °C 和 33 °C。混凝土的導熱率為1.10 W m<sup>–1</sup> K<sup>–1</sup>。求熱以傳導作用通過牆壁的傳遞率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/dfee1abfacc731ccaffcb0e3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:181.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>熱傳遞率</p><p>= κ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{A(T_{H} - T_{C})}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.10 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>25</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{9 \\times  (33 - 25)}{0.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 792 W</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":4,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,469.6628951171875,557.4491,650.9794006347656],"text":"例 題 1 傳導作用的熱傳遞率\r\n房間面向室外的混凝土牆厚 10 cm，面積\r\n為 9 m2\r\n。空調機開動後，牆壁兩面的温\r\n度為 25 °C 和 33 °C。混凝土的導熱率為\r\n1.10 W m–1 K–1。求熱以傳導作用通過牆\r\n壁的傳遞率。\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,650.9794006347656,557.4491,745.5158951171875],"text":"題解\r\n熱傳遞率\r\n= κ \r\nA(TH – TC)\r\nd\r\n = 1.10 ×\r\n9 × (33 – 25)\r\n0.1\r\n = 792 W\r\n空調機\r\n9 m2\r\n33 °C\r\n10 cm\r\n25 °C\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-2":{"id":"ex-E303-2","chapter":"E303","number":2,"title":"熱傳遞率與 U 值","question":"<p>(a) 隔熱牆的尺寸為 6 m × 3 m，牆壁兩面的温度分別為 31 °C 和23 °C。求熱通過牆壁的傳遞率。牆壁的 U 值為 0.61 W m<sup>–2</sup> K<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(b) 如果這幅牆以大小相同但 U 值較高的牆壁取代，熱通過牆壁的傳遞率會怎樣改變？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/0a9b1871e8421e96a53c69b5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:197.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 牆壁的面積 = 6 × 3 = 18 m<sup>2</sup> 熱傳遞率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UA</annotation></semantics></math></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span> – <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span>） = 0.61 × 18 ×（ 31 – 23）= 87.8 W</p><p>(b) 熱傳遞率會增加。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":7,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,562.4491,358.24139404296875],"text":"例 題 2 熱傳遞率與 U 值\r\n(a) 隔熱牆的尺寸為 6 m × 3 m，牆壁兩面的温度分別為 31 °C 和\r\n23 °C。求熱通過牆壁的傳遞率。牆壁的 U 值為0.61 W m–2 K–1。\r\n3 m\r\n6 m\r\n23 °C 31 °C\r\n(b) 如果這幅牆以大小相同但 U 值較高的牆壁取代，熱通過牆壁的傳\r\n遞率會怎樣改變？\r\n"},{"page":7,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,358.24139404296875,562.4491,459.7778951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 牆壁的面積 = 6 × 3 = 18 m2\r\n熱傳遞率 = UA（TH – TC） = 0.61 × 18 ×（31 – 23）= 87.8 W\r\n(b) 熱傳遞率會增加。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-3":{"id":"ex-E303-3","chapter":"E303","number":3,"title":"複合牆的 U 值","question":"<p>牆壁由厚度不同的混凝土層和木纖維層組成，兩層之間沒有空隙。牆壁兩面的温度保持在 32 °C 和 25 °C。</p><p>已知：</p><p>混凝土層的 U 值 = 5.5 W m<sup>–2</sup> K<sup>–1</sup> 木纖維層的 U 值 = 0.95 W m<sup>–2</sup> K<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(a) 求牆壁的 U 值。</p><p>(b) 在兩層物料的接面，温度是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/9a17106c2fb3b516fb1c3441.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:188.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 整幅牆兩面的温差相等於每層物料兩面的温差之和。</p><p>∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = ∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + ∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ......... (1) 通過每層物料的熱傳遞率與通過整幅牆的熱傳遞率相同，設這熱傳遞率為 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>考慮整幅牆：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UA</annotation></semantics></math></span>∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> ⇒ ∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{r}{UA}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>考慮混凝土層：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ⇒ ∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{r}{U_{c} A}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>考慮木纖維層：<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ⇒ ∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{r}{U_{w}A}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>所以 (1) 可改寫成：</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{r}{UA}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{r}{U_{c} A}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{r}{U_{w}A}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>U</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{U}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{U_{c}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{U_{w}}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5.5</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{5.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>0.95</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{0.95}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.810 W m<sup>–2</sup> K<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(b) 設 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 為接面的温度。</p><p>混凝土層的熱傳遞率 = 木纖維層的熱傳遞率</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span>∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{c}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span>∆<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{w}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>(5.5)(<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>)(32 − <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></span>) = (0.95)(<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>)(<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></span> − 25)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{j}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 31.0 °C</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718752,557.4491,270.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 3 複合牆的 U 值\r\n牆壁由厚度不同的混凝土層和木纖維層組成，兩層之間沒有空隙。牆\r\n壁兩面的温度保持在 32 °C 和 25 °C。\r\n已知：\r\n混凝土層的 U 值 = 5.5 W m–2 K–1\r\n木纖維層的 U 值 = 0.95 W m–2 K–1\r\n(a) 求牆壁的 U 值。\r\n(b) 在兩層物料的接面，温度是多少？\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,270.81585693359375,557.4491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 整幅牆兩面的温差相等於每層物料兩面的温差之和。\r\n∆T = ∆Tc + ∆Tw ......... (1)\r\n通過每層物料的熱傳遞率與通過整幅牆的熱傳遞率相同，設這熱\r\n傳遞率為 r。\r\n考慮整幅牆：r = UA∆T ⇒ ∆T = r\r\nUA\r\n考慮混凝土層：r = Uc A∆Tc ⇒ ∆Tc = r\r\nUcA\r\n考慮木纖維層：r = Uw A∆Tw ⇒ ∆Tw = r\r\nUw A\r\n所以 (1) 可改寫成：\r\n r\r\nUA = r\r\nUcA\r\n + r\r\nUw A\r\n 1\r\nU = 1\r\nUc\r\n + \r\n1\r\nUw\r\n = 1\r\n5.5\r\n + \r\n1\r\n0.95\r\nU = 0.810 W m–2 K–1\r\n(b) 設 Tj 為接面的温度。\r\n混凝土層的熱傳遞率 = 木纖維層的熱傳遞率\r\nUcAc∆Tc = Uw Aw∆Tw\r\n (5.5)(A)(32 − Tj) = (0.95)(A)(Tj − 25)\r\nTj = 31.0 °C\r\n混凝土 \r\n(Uc)\r\n木纖維 (Uw)\r\n32 °C 25 °C\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-4":{"id":"ex-E303-4","chapter":"E303","number":4,"title":"熱以傳導作用通過帶窗的牆的總傳遞率","question":"<p>圖示大廈的一幅牆闊 50 m，高 170 m，牆上有 552 扇相同的窗，每個面積為 8.7 m<sup>2</sup>。如果大廈內外的温差為 8 °C，求熱以傳導作用通過該幅帶窗的牆的總傳遞率。</p><p>已知窗的 U 值為 2.8 W m<sup>–2</sup> K<sup>–1</sup>，牆的 U 值為 4.2 W m<sup>–2</sup> K<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/938f1b53c7b1c06c34591889.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:183.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>應用 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Q}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UA</annotation></semantics></math></span>(<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span> − <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span>)。</p><p>熱以傳導作用通過全部窗的傳遞率</p><p>= 2.8 × (552 × 8.7) × 8 = 108 000 W</p><p>熱以傳導作用通過牆（不包括窗）的傳遞率</p><p>= 4.2 × (50 × 170 – 552 × 8.7) × 8 = 124 000 W</p><p>熱以傳導作用通過帶窗的牆的總傳遞率</p><p>= 108 000 + 124 000 = 232 000 W</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":9,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,100.64189511718746,562.4491,383.23309326171875],"text":"例 題 4 熱以傳導作用通過帶窗的牆的總傳遞率\r\n圖示大廈的一幅牆闊 50 m，高 170 m，牆上有 552 扇相同的窗，每\r\n個面積為 8.7 m2\r\n。如果大廈內外的温差為 8 °C，求熱以傳導作用通過\r\n該幅帶窗的牆的總傳遞率。\r\n已知窗的 U 值為 2.8 W m–2 K–1，牆的 U 值為 4.2 W m–2 K–1。\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,383.23309326171875,562.4491,577.7698951171875],"text":"題解\r\n應用 Q\r\nt\r\n = UA(TH − TC)。\r\n熱以傳導作用通過全部窗的傳遞率\r\n= 2.8 × (552 × 8.7) × 8 = 108 000 W\r\n熱以傳導作用通過牆（不包括窗）的傳遞率\r\n= 4.2 × (50 × 170 – 552 × 8.7) × 8 = 124 000 W\r\n熱以傳導作用通過帶窗的牆的總傳遞率\r\n= 108 000 + 124 000 = 232 000 W\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-5":{"id":"ex-E303-5","chapter":"E303","number":5,"title":"通過不同玻璃窗的輻射","question":"<p>志文設置以下實驗裝置，以量度箱內的温度升幅。箱子有一個開口，裝上玻璃窗後，箱子便完全密封。</p><p>志文把兩款玻璃窗先後安裝到開口，發現即使雙層玻璃窗的 U 值較低，但温度升幅卻與單層玻璃窗差不多。試解釋實驗結果。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/4a48e47fe745c43deeb2a98a.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:395.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>U 值與熱傳導作用有關，但在這實驗中，熱主要以輻射作用傳遞，而通過這兩款玻璃窗的輻射量大致相同，所以箱子不論安裝哪一款玻璃窗，温度升幅都差不多。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":10,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,357.6668951171875,557.6491,650.7480010986328],"text":"例 題 5 通過不同玻璃窗的輻射\r\n志文設置以下實驗裝置，以量度箱內的温度升幅。箱子有一個開口，\r\n裝上玻璃窗後，箱子便完全密封。\r\n温度感應器\r\n安裝玻璃窗的開口\r\n200 W 鎢絲燈\r\n20 mm 厚的\r\n單層玻璃窗\r\n20 mm 厚的\r\n雙層玻璃窗\r\n箱子\r\n志文把兩款玻璃窗先後安裝到開口，發現即使雙層玻璃窗的 U 值較\r\n低，但温度升幅卻與單層玻璃窗差不多。試解釋實驗結果。\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,650.7480010986328,557.6491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題解\r\nU 值與熱傳導作用有關，但在這實驗中，熱主要以輻射作用傳遞，而\r\n通過這兩款玻璃窗的輻射量大致相同，所以箱子不論安裝哪一款玻璃\r\n窗，温度升幅都差不多。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-6":{"id":"ex-E303-6","chapter":"E303","number":6,"title":"樓宇的 OTTV","question":"<p>某大廈有四幅牆和一個屋頂，牆上有多扇雙層玻璃窗，這些窗的總面積為 700 m<sup>2</sup>。下表顯示牆壁和屋頂的特性。</p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p></p></td><td><p>牆壁（不包括窗）</p></td><td><p>屋頂</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>總面積 / m<sup>2</sup></p></td><td><p>4000</p></td><td><p>400</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>U 值 / W m<sup>–2</sup> K<sup>–1</sup></p></td><td><p>0.6</p></td><td><p>0.4</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>(a) 大廈內外的等效温差為 5 °C。求熱通過牆壁和屋頂的總傳遞率。</p><p>(b) 熱通過窗戶每單位面積的傳遞率為 130 W m<sup>–2</sup>，求熱通過窗戶的總傳遞率。</p><p>(c) 求大廈的 OTTV。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Q}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">UA</annotation></semantics></math></span>(<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{H}</annotation></semantics></math></span> − <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span>)，</p><p>熱通過牆壁和屋頂的總傳遞率</p><p>= 0.6 × 4000 × 5 + 0.4 × 400 × 5</p><p>= 12 800 W</p><p>(b) 熱通過窗戶的總傳遞率 = 130 × 700</p><p>= 91 000 W</p><p>(c) OTTV = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>平均熱傳遞率</mtext><mtext>總面積</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{平均熱傳遞率}{總面積}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>12800</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>91000</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>700</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{12 800 + 91 000}{4000 + 400 + 700}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 20.4 W m<sup>–2</sup></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,305.2485656738281],"text":"例 題 6 樓宇的 OTTV\r\n某大廈有四幅牆和一個屋頂，牆上有多扇雙層玻璃窗，這些窗的總面\r\n積為 700 m2\r\n。下表顯示牆壁和屋頂的特性。\r\n牆壁（不包括窗） 屋 頂\r\n總面積 / m2 4000 400\r\nU 值 / W m–2 K–1 0.6 0.4\r\n(a) 大廈內外的等效温差為 5 °C。求熱通過牆壁和屋頂的總傳遞率。\r\n(b) 熱通過窗戶每單位面積的傳遞率為 130 W m–2，求熱通過窗戶的\r\n總傳遞率。\r\n(c) 求大廈的 OTTV。\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,305.2485656738281,562.4491,524.3698951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 根據 Q\r\nt\r\n = UA(TH − TC)，\r\n熱通過牆壁和屋頂的總傳遞率\r\n = 0.6 × 4000 × 5 + 0.4 × 400 × 5 \r\n = 12 800 W\r\n(b) 熱通過窗戶的總傳遞率 = 130 × 700 \r\n = 91 000 W\r\n(c) OTTV = 平均熱傳遞率\r\n總面積 = 12 800 + 91 000\r\n4000 + 400 + 700\r\n = 20.4 W m–2\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-7":{"id":"ex-E303-7","chapter":"E303","number":7,"title":"為電動車的電池組充電","question":"<p>一電動車的電池組容量為 24 kW h。司機想將電池組的電量從 0% 充至總容量的 80%。如果使用中速充電器，電池組會以 220 V 的端電壓和 32 A 的平均電流充電。充電過程需時多久？假設充電過程中沒有能量損耗。</p>","answer":"<p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VIt</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{E}{VI}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>220</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{24 \\times  10^{3} \\times  80\\%}{220 \\times  32}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 2.73 h</p><p>充電過程需 2.73 小時。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>在方程 E = VIt 中，如果 E</p><p>以 W h 表示，t 的單位應為 h。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":25,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,428.4318951171875,562.6491,555.7480010986328],"text":"例 題 7 為電動車的電池組充電\r\n一電動車的電池組容量為 24 kW h。司機想將電池組的電量從 0% 充\r\n至總容量的 80%。如果使用中速充電器，電池組會以 220 V 的端電\r\n壓和 32 A 的平均電流充電。充電過程需時多久？假設充電過程中沒\r\n有能量損耗。\r\n"},{"page":25,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,555.7480010986328,562.6491,743.2848951171875],"text":"題解\r\n根據 E = VIt，\r\nt = E\r\nVI\r\n = 24 × 103 × 80%\r\n220 × 32\r\n = 2.73 h\r\n充電過程需 2.73 小時。\r\n"},{"page":25,"kind":"tips","box":[40,424.4318951171875,181.6491,743.2848951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n在方程 E = VIt 中， 如 果\r\nE 的單位是 W h，那麼 t 的\r\n單位便是 h。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-8":{"id":"ex-E303-8","chapter":"E303","number":8,"title":"電動車的電池組容量和續行里程","question":"<p>一電動車電池組的容量為 60 kW h。汽車以 30 km h<sup>–1</sup> 的恆速率行駛時，電動機消耗的功率為 4 kW。</p><p>(a) 由於電路有能量的損耗，提供給電動機的總能量只及電池組儲存的 85%。估算電動車以這模式行駛時的續行里程。</p><p>(b) 電動機的輸出能量主要用在哪方面？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 電動機的總輸出能量 = 60 × 85% = 51 kW h</p><p>根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Pt</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p>消耗上述能量所需的時間 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{E}{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>51</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{51}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 12.75 小時</p><p>電動車的續行里程 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">vt</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 30 × 12.75 = 383 km</p><p>(b) 電動機的輸出能量主要用於克服摩擦力和空氣阻力。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":26,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,53.49989511718741,557.6491,208.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 8 電動車的電池組容量和續行里程\r\n一電動車電池組的容量為 60 kW h。汽車以 30 km h–1 的恆速率行駛\r\n時，電動機消耗的功率為 4 kW。\r\n(a) 由於電路有能量的損耗，提供給電動機的總能量只及電池組儲存\r\n的 85%。估算電動車以這模式行駛時的續行里程。\r\n(b) 電動機的輸出能量主要用在哪方面？\r\n"},{"page":26,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,208.81585693359375,557.6491,372.3528951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 電動機的總輸出能量 = 60 × 85% = 51 kW h\r\n根據 E = Pt，\r\n消耗上述能量所需的時間 = E\r\nP\r\n = 51\r\n4\r\n = 12.75 小時\r\n電動車的續行里程 = vt = 30 × 12.75 = 383 km\r\n(b) 電動機的輸出能量主要用於克服摩擦力和空氣阻力。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-9":{"id":"ex-E303-9","chapter":"E303","number":9,"title":"駕駛汽車的費用","question":"<p>一名顧客正在燃油汽車和電動汽車之間作選擇。</p><p>(a) 提出兩個原因，解釋為甚麼電動車比體積相若的燃油車更節能。</p><p>(b) 燃油汽車每 100 km 消耗 7.8 L 燃油，電動汽車每 100 km 消耗 14.3 kW h 電能。每升燃油售價 $15，每 kW h 電力售價 $2.9。假設汽車平均每天行駛 60 km，各車每天使用的燃油／電力費用是多少？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 在能量轉換方面，電動機的效率比內燃機高。</p><p>電動車配備再生煞車系統，可在煞車時把車輛的動能轉換回電池中的化學能，以供日後使用。</p><p>(b) 燃油汽車每天使用的燃油</p><p>= 7.8 × <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 4.68 L</p><p>每天的燃油費用</p><p>= 15 × 4.68 = $70.2</p><p>電動汽車每天使用的電能</p><p>= 14.3 × <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 8.58 kW h</p><p>每天的電費</p><p>= 2.9 × 8.58 = $24.9</p><p>練習 3.2 第 9 題（第 120 頁）</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":28,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,53.49989511718752,557.6491,240.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 9 駕駛汽車的費用\r\n陳先生在選購汽車，未決定買化石燃料車還是電動車。\r\n(a) 為甚麼電動車的能源效益比大小相若的化石燃料車高？舉出兩個\r\n原因。\r\n(b) 每行駛 100 km，化石燃料車 X 消耗 7.8 L 燃料，每公升燃料的價\r\n格為 $15；電動車 Y 則消耗 14.3 kW h 電能，每 kW h 電能的價\r\n格為 $2.9。假設陳先生每天駕駛 60 km，駕駛 X 每天的費用是多\r\n少？駕駛 Y 的費用又是多少？\r\n"},{"page":28,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,240.81585693359375,557.6491,578.3528951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 電動機轉換能量的效率比內燃機高。\r\n電動車配備再生制動系統，可把動能轉換成電池的化學能以備\r\n後用。\r\n(b) X 每天消耗的燃料\r\n = 78 ×\r\n60\r\n100\r\n = 4.68 L\r\n每天的燃料費\r\n = 15 × 4.68 = $70.2\r\nY 每天消耗的電能\r\n = 14.3 ×\r\n60\r\n100\r\n = 8.58 kW h\r\n每天的電費\r\n = 2.9 × 8.58 = $24.9 單元練習 3.2 Q9 (p.120)\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-10":{"id":"ex-E303-10","chapter":"E303","number":10,"title":"用內燃機為電池充電","question":"<p>有些混合動力車以低速行駛時，內燃機在驅動汽車之餘，還可為電池充電。</p><p>(a) 為甚麼這些車以低速行駛時，可以為電池充電？</p><p>(b) 簡單描述這充電過程的能量轉換。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 低速行駛所需的功率較小，所以內燃機可把多餘的功率用於充電。</p><p>(b) 汽油的化學能→ 發電機的動能→ 電能→ 電池組的化學能</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":30,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,433.5528951171875,557.6491,578.8690032958984],"text":"例 題 10 用內燃機為電池充電\r\n有些混合動力車以低速行駛時，內燃機在驅動汽車之餘，還可為電池\r\n充電。\r\n(a) 為甚麼這些車以低速行駛時，可以為電池充電？\r\n(b) 簡單描述這充電過程的能量轉換。\r\n"},{"page":30,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,578.8690032958984,557.6491,718.4058951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 低速行駛所需的功率較小，所以內燃機可把多餘的功率用於充電。\r\n(b) 汽油的化學能\r\n→ 發電機的動能\r\n→ 電能\r\n→ 電池組的化學能\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E303-11":{"id":"ex-E303-11","chapter":"E303","number":11,"title":"巴士和私家車消耗的能量","question":"<p>香港每天約有三百萬名乘客乘搭巴士。假設所有乘客改為乘搭的士。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/8d4e613bc2f8f3de536aab2b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:265.5px\"></p><p>(a) 這些乘客每行駛一公里，會多消耗多少能量？巴士及的士每人每公里所需的能量分別約為 1.5 × 10<sup>6</sup> J 和 2.9 × 10<sup>6</sup> J。</p><p>(b) 這些乘客每行駛一公里，會多排放多少二氧化碳？巴士及的士每人每公里的二氧化碳排放量分別為 38 g 和 120 g。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 每公里額外消耗的能量</p><p>= (2.9 − 1.5) × 10<sup>6</sup> × 3 × 10<sup>6</sup></p><p>= 4.2 × 10<sup>12</sup> J</p><p>(b) 每公里額外排放的二氧化碳</p><p>= (120 – 38) × 3 × 10<sup>6</sup> = 2.46 × 10<sup>8</sup> g</p><p>= 2.46 × 10<sup>5</sup> kg</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E303_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"9bd2f46659adf59b8216cea8da519159e801ce2808e2e52b77981d5fd99fa19a","segments":[{"page":35,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,53.49989511718752,562.6491,374.785888671875],"text":"例 題 11 巴士和私家車消耗的能量\r\n本港每天約有三百萬人次乘坐巴士。假設他們全部改乘的士。\r\n(a) 接載這批乘客行駛每公里路所需的能量增加了多少？已知接載每\r\n名乘客行駛每公里路所需的能量，巴士約為 1.5 × 106\r\n J，的士約\r\n為 2.9 × 106\r\n J。\r\n(b) 接載這批乘客行駛每公里路所排放的二氧化碳增加了多少？已知\r\n接載每名乘客行駛每公里路的二氧化碳排放量，巴士約為 38 g，\r\n的士約為 120 g。\r\n"},{"page":35,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,374.785888671875,562.6491,533.3228951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 每公里額外消耗的能量\r\n = (2.9 − 1.5) × 106 × 3 × 106\r\n = 4.2 × 1012 J\r\n(b) 每公里額外排放的二氧化碳\r\n = (120 – 38) × 3 × 106\r\n = 2.46 × 108\r\n g \r\n = 2.46 × 105\r\n kg\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}